pele-rs is an independent Rust adaptation inspired by Pele, not an official
Obsidian, Pele or Mermaid project.

Pele: https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele
Reference revision: 458322a5b8abb1ae57ddf127c32017ab9fb14a92
