Pele's flowchart parser, graph representation and layered-layout architecture
inform this implementation. The initial Rust implementation is independently
written; it does not claim complete parser or pixel parity with Pele.

Mermaid: https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
The supported diagram language is a documented subset of Mermaid flowcharts.
No upstream Mermaid test files or generated parsers are included in this slice.

